2. PRODUCT FullVideo Supreme Video Card

OVERVIEW:

Digital's FullVideo Supreme is a video capture and output card. When used
in conjunction with Multimedia Services for Digital UNIX, users can develop
and use multimedia applications that incorporate both full motion video,
video clips, and stills.  Users can also develop cross-platform video and
