The rackmount VAX 4000 Models 505A and 705A provide maximum system growth
and flexibility. These rackmount systems will be available with the new
three-year hardware warranty later this year, along with a new rackmount
Model 106A.

Rackmounting provides a cost effective way to organize systems, storage, and
other options in one easily accessible, 19-inch-wide EIA rackmount cabinet
and thus in a small footprint. Rackmount Models 505A and 705A require only
14 inches of vertical rack, cabinet, or enclosure space; and support two
additional high speed DSSI controllers and/or the new HSD05 DSSI-to-SCSI
controllers.

