   (Network Application Support) 200 licenses for DECnet, TCP/IP, PATHWORKS,
   Polycenter Distribution Client, DECwindows Motif, ObjectBroker,
   DECmessageQ, and DECprint software.
o  In-cabinet upgrades from the Models 40, 85, and 95; plus system trade-ins
   for MicroVAX II, 2000, 3100, 3100e, and VAX-11 Model 7xx, 82xx, and 83xx
   users (see the "VAX to VAX Upgrades" article in this issue).

