addition, Model 85 Base Systems (DV-31JAA-C9/E9) are orderable through July
29 only and do not include the three-year warranty.

The MicroVAX 3100 Models 85 and 96 ship with OpenVMS V6.1, and also support
OpenVMS V5.5-2H4 and higher. The MicroVAX 3100 Model 40 supports OpenVMS
