DWZZB-MA	 For OEM use (module)
DWZZB-VW	 For use in StorageWorks shelves

SERVICES

The standard warranty includes one year of onsite service and an additional
two years of return-to-factory service. Standard support services are also
available.

TECHNICAL DATA

The DWZZB is bi-directional in operation and can be cascaded. No more than
two can be attached to a bus in a series. Termination on the single-ended
side is user selectable. The 16-bit wide differential side features user
removable resistors.

Configuration Specifications

