Business Recovery Server V1.3 Supports OpenVMS VAX and Alpha V6.1

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Supports OpenVMS VAX V6.1 and OpenVMS Alpha V6.1 in a cluster

o  Supports Alpha and VAX systems in a mixed architecture cluster, including
   support for VAX 4xxx, DEC 4xxx, AlphaServer 2100 departmental systems,
   and Alpha datacenter class systems

o  Supports HSJ and HSD storage controllers

o  Will support ATM (Asynchronous Transfer Mode) later this spring

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Digital's Business Recovery Server V1.3 is a software and services solution
that integrates VMScluster systems, Volume Shadowing software, FDDI or T3
technology, and Digital's system and network management tools into redundant
system and operations management platforms.

Using V1.3, disaster recovery can be accomplished in seconds or minutes,
depending on the user's configuration; and the business operation can
continue running at the operational site with minimal disruption. With T3
land line support, distances between sites can now be extended up to 500
cable route miles. However, a Proof of Concept of the user's configuration
for distances from 150 to 500 cable route miles is required and must be
purchased by the user.

Business Recovery Server integration packages include:

o  Busines Recovery Server Configuration and Installation Services --
   Provides the framework for the successful implementation of a
   disaster-tolerant VMScluster system.

o  Operations Management Station Integration Software -- Used in conjunction
   with Digital's system and network management tools, this software allows
   for the rapid recovery of business critical computing resources at the
   operational datacenter or site.

o  Operations Management Station Software Installation Service -- Includes
   review of the current and planned disaster-tolerant configuration,
   Operations Management Station software customization and installation,
   system and operator training on the use of the Operations Management
   Station product, and hands-on orientation to verify and ensure rapid
   recovery from a failure, fault, or disaster.

The Business Recovery Server packages combine the Operations Management
Station integration software with the Business Recovery Server Configuration
and Installation Services to ensure configuration integrity and efficient
and proper system management capabilities for implementing a
disaster-tolerant cluster solution.

The tested and supported disaster-tolerant cluster package addresses the
systems, components, and system and network management platform needed for a
user's business-critical computing environment. By partnering with Digital
to achieve the computing solution needed to support business objectives,
users can focus on their business goals.

