LG04plus Line Matrix Printer

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Print speed of 467 lines per minute

o  Has LP+, Proprinter, Epson, and Sixel emulations with optional PGL and
   VGL industry-standard emulations

o  High level of reliability, high quality print output, and virtually
   unlimited duty cycle

o  Optional networking device, Rapid Print 200, allows the LG04plus to be
   used in a network environment

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The LG04plus line matrix printer offers the highest level of reliability,
print quality, and flexibility in a line printer at a low cost. All of these
characteristics make the LG04plus best suited for mission critical
activities, such as check printing and invoices.

This product has been developed and manufactured with reliability in mind.
With a 10,000 hour mean time between failure and an unlimited duty cycle,
the LG04plus offers users the highest level of reliability for mission
critical activities. A new hammer bank has been incorporated into the new
LG04plus, allowing for greater uptime and improved print quality. When
printing bar codes, dot placement is a critical element. If the bar code is
printed out of registration, misreadings will occur, causing inefficiencies
in bar coding needs. To solve this, Digital has improved the dot placement
on the LG04plus to a vertical registration of .0005. Of all the line
printers made today, no others even come close to this tight tolerance.

With a print speed of 467 lines per minute, the LG04plus offers a low cost
solution to those users who require higher duty cycles than the LA600
offers, and for whom the LG06, at 800 lines per minute, is beyond their
budget.

Utilizing a new networking box from Digital called Rapid Print, the
versatility of the LG04plus expands even further. The Rapid Print 200
printer interface is a powerful multiprotocol interface that can support two
directly connected high performance printers.

BENEFITS

o  At 467 lines per minute, the LG04plus gives users the ability to utilize
   line matrix printing.

o  Optional PGL and VGL emulations allow users to go outside of the Digital
   computing environment.

o  Utilizing Rapid Print, the LG04plus can be connected into a networked
   environment, allowing for multiple users.

o  Superior reliability and an unlimited duty cycle accommodate those
   mission critical activities that must be done on time.

o  Low noise level allows use in an office environment, yet it is rugged
   enough to be used in a factory.

o  Cost effective Postnet bar codes can be imprinted directly on labels and
   shipping documents.

o  The LG04plus is capable of printing on multipart forms (up to 6 parts)
   with text and graphics capabilities.

o  New hammer bank design allows for reliable, high quality printing.

o  The LG04plus requires a low cost of ownership and is compatible with the
   existing LG06 and LG12 printers.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The LG04plus line matrix printer is available now.

