POWERswitch Redundant Power Capability for Networks

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Guards against network downtime due to loss of AC power

o  Provides two independent AC power sources for a wide variety of
   networking devices

o  Senses loss of AC power from primary power source and automatically
   switches to the backup AC power source

o  Easy to install

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The POWERswitch is a standalone device that is designed to provide redundant
AC power to attached devices by automatically sensing a loss of AC power
from a primary AC power source and switching to a secondary power source.

The POWERswitch attaches directly to either the DEChub 90 or DEChub 900
multislot hub chassis using existing screw holes. In addition, its compact
modular design allows it to be mounted in any industry-standard 19-inch rack
or mounted on a wall. This installation flexibility extends the benefit of
redundant AC power to stackable standalone network devices, such as DEChub
ONE products, and a wide variety of other networking devices.

Indicator lights on the outside of the POWERswitch will show the presence of
a primary power source, the presence of an auxiliary power source, and that
AC is present. In the event of a failure of the primary power source, the
POWERswitch will switch to auxiliary power within 20 milliseconds, meaning
no network connection loss. When the primary power source returns, the
POWERswitch will then switch back to the primary source within 20
milliseconds.

BENEFITS

o  Provides redundancy and fault tolerance for mission critical applications
o  Provides uninterruptible AC power to attached devices
o  Modular, standalone packaging offers the option of providing redundant AC
   power to a wide variety of networking devices
o  User installable

PRODUCT POSITIONING

The POWERswitch is a unique Digital product that can be used with any of
Digital's networking products. It is particularly useful in providing
redundant AC power for products, such as the DEChub family. It satisfies the
need for fault tolerence and redundancy for intelligent hub products used in
mission critical applications.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The POWERswitch is now available through Digital, its authorized resellers,
value-added resellers, OEMs, wholesale distributors, and the DECdirect
service.

